sequenceDiagram
 autonumber
actor U as Presenter
 participant A as Android host
 participant L as Native / local store
 participant API as Django API
 Note over U,API: 4A. Durable capture: unmerged | Pre-upload disclosure: Planned
 U->>A: Start recording
 A->>L: Request microphone permission
 alt Permission denied
  L-->>A: Denied
  A-->>U: Explain denial, remain idle
 else Permission granted
  A->>L: Persist new UUID, audio target and<br/>checkpoint
  A->>L: Start capture, initial slide event at 0 ms
  loop Confirmed page changes
   L-->>A: Audio time + confirmed original slide<br/>index
   A->>L: Checkpoint event, retain repeated/backward<br/>visits
  end
  U->>A: Stop
  A->>L: Finalize audio and durably save attempt
  L-->>A: Saved recording, local playback available
  A-->>U: Planned: disclose PDF/audio upload +<br/>transcription before transfer
  alt Consent declined
   A-->>U: Keep local playback, no upload or polling
  else Valid consent for this destination and use
   U->>A: Accept, or use stored valid disclosure
   A->>L: Planned: record disclosure version and<br/>destination
   A->>API: POST /api/decks/ if needed, then<br/>/api/attempts/
   Note right of API: Prepare PDF slides, persist files and<br/>rows.
   alt Upload fails / acknowledgment lost
    API--xA: No confirmed server attempt
    A-->>U: Keep local playback, offer explicit upload<br/>retry
    Note over A,API: Same UUID/content on upload retry.<br/>No polling without a known server attempt.
   else Upload acknowledged
    API-->>A: attempt_id + pending state
    Note over A,API: Continue at 4B. Current client uploads before disclosure,<br/>this diagram shows the Planned correction.
   end
  end
 end
